{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0050","paragraphs":[{"id":"pd8ecf67914e3-1","text":"芙蓉落尽天涵水。"},{"id":"pd3ce353f680b-1","text":"日暮沧波起。"},{"id":"pf51fc2f29a25-1","text":"背飞双燕帖云寒。"},{"id":"pc88850f0e76f-1","text":"独向小楼东畔、倚阑看。"},{"id":"pebe9c2340370-1","text":"浮生只合尊前老。"},{"id":"pbc933933f912-1","text":"雪满长安道。"},{"id":"pcc0f5033c57e-1","text":"故人早晚上高台。"},{"id":"p4113c818c5ab-1","text":"赠我江南春色、一枝梅。"}]}